<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: Thank you for answering. We plan to raid a reclamation company site and hope you can help us crush them. Will you? -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestA3_AllianceContact.desc>感谢你的接听，我们计划袭击回收公司的据点，希望你们可以协助我们击溃他们。可以吗？</MCW_Event_QuestA3_AllianceContact.desc>
  <!-- EN: Assist the raid -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestA3_AllianceContact.label>袭击协助</MCW_Event_QuestA3_AllianceContact.label>
  <!-- EN: Accept the request and join the Mincho Alliance in raiding the reclamation force outpost. -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestA3_AllianceContact.options.0.desc>接受协助请求，与珉巧同盟一起突袭回收部队的前哨站。</MCW_Event_QuestA3_AllianceContact.options.0.desc>
  <!-- EN: Yes - we were planning to give them a beating too! -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestA3_AllianceContact.options.0.label>是-我们也打算狠狠收拾他们！</MCW_Event_QuestA3_AllianceContact.options.0.label>
  <!-- EN: Decline the request. Qinxintang opinion of you will drop. -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestA3_AllianceContact.options.1.desc>拒绝协助请求。沁心糖对你的好感度会下降。</MCW_Event_QuestA3_AllianceContact.options.1.desc>
  <!-- EN: No - sorry, we cannot help you right now -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestA3_AllianceContact.options.1.label>否-抱歉，我们目前没法帮助你</MCW_Event_QuestA3_AllianceContact.options.1.label>
  <!-- EN: Decide later and close the window. You can contact the Mincho Alliance again when ready. -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestA3_AllianceContact.options.2.desc>暂时不做决定，关闭窗口。准备好后可以重新联络珉巧同盟。</MCW_Event_QuestA3_AllianceContact.options.2.desc>
  <!-- EN: Later - soon! We are making powerful weapons! -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestA3_AllianceContact.options.2.label>待定-马上！我们正在制作强大的武器！</MCW_Event_QuestA3_AllianceContact.options.2.label>
  <!-- EN: Qinxintang -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestA3_AllianceContact.title>沁心糖</MCW_Event_QuestA3_AllianceContact.title>

